class csmp::EffectiveStressVisitor< dim >"effective- and mean stress, by post-processing of a diagonalized stress tensor with fluid pressure as input\&. 
.SH "Member Function Documentation"
.PP 
.SS "template<uint32_t dim> void \fBcsmp::EffectiveStressVisitor\fP< dim >::Visit (\fBElement\fP< dim > * e)\fR [virtual]\fP"
Interpolates fluid pressure to the integration points and subtracts it from the diagonal components of the stress tensor\&.

.PP
Optionally, the mean stress can be computed as well\&.

.PP
\fBAttention\fP
.RS 4
the input must be a diagonalized stress tensor else this will not work\&. 
.RE
